Description: full-screen magnifier for X11 driven by Ctrl+Shift+scroll
 Zooms the whole screen around the pointer with modifier plus two-finger
 scroll, pans when the pointer reaches a screen edge, and goes away when
 zoomed back out to 1.0x. Useful for reading small text.
 .
 The zoomed view is currently a snapshot taken when zooming starts.
